{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_2","type":"agent_message","text":"{\"submission\": \"submission-map-c8b.json\", \"summary\": \"Turn 78 recorded the second liveness scenario in the map and certified that the run's source coverage is complete.\\n\\nState on entry. The second C8 scenario is confirmed: after the executor's timeout enqueues a blocked instance, handing that entry to the recovery entry leaves the record in preparing state with one self reply and its Prepare emitted, so the timeout path leads to a live recovery attempt rather than only to a signal.\\n\\nMap update (accepted base version 16, one clarified behavior). The executor's existing-protection entry now records both confirmed steps — the enqueue and the recovery start that follows it, with the C8 citation. The scan, watermark advance and other effects of the executor are unchanged, and the map_changes entry carries the sources and a preserves explanation.\\n\\nSource coverage. All files named in this run's analysis roots have now been read: the protocol package, its helpers (replica, state, rpc, replica/defs including the latency table), the client library, the master, the configuration and the three unused helper files. Two unread *semantics* are named rather than implied: how the delivery-delay table shapes scheduling in a deployment, and the GPropose proxy flag that the epaxos path sets but never consumes — both noted as unread rather than as discrepancies.\\n\\nFrontier. Eleven claim families are settled — nine confirmed violations or consequences (C1 with its six artifacts including the driven-history one, C2, C3, C4, C6, C7, C9, C10 with three codec scenarios, C11) and two bounded no-violation protections (C5, C8 with two scenarios) — with two candidates paused on scoped resume conditions, one issue structurally unresolvable on a superseded artifact, and the outstanding unread items limited to the reader-side reaction to a displaced stream, the delay table's scheduling effect, and the proxy flag. No requirement, premise or earlier observation was weakened.\"}"}}
